{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Glitch Zone has taken over Town Square! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Mr Square and solve 20 Trial-and-Error Style puzzles!  <br>Can you beat them all? Or will they beat you?<br><br><br>Walk through the Mega Mountain to encounter new trials! <br>Take a walk along Breezy Beach to discover all the secrets! <br>Explore the Forest and discover the hidden mystery deep within!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/9a75c258143db22a7e05085eda9515d1.avif?t=1766100776\" width=443 height=94 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Trial and Error levels!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Bonus and 2 extra levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Housing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ outfits to unlock and wear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Glitch Zone Levels!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively Town Hub with fun NPC\u2019s to interact with!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find pets and let them accompany you on your journey!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and create your own party of followers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game pass!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 50Gig updates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Blood donations required to play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/c3aaed6f2870bc3fd3501438183770b0.avif?t=1766100776\" width=696 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_